							"width": 456,
							"height": 88,
							"text": "What this shows. The main data types in FinRisk. Asset is an abstract type with four concrete subtypes Stock ETF Bond CryptoAsset. Transaction is an abstract type with two concrete subtypes BuyTransaction SellTransaction. A User owns one or more Accounts. An Account executes zero or more Transactions. Each Transaction references one Asset."
