							"width": 296,
							"height": 96,
							"text": "What this shows. Services hold the business rules. They orchestrate DAOs but never write SQL directly. TransactionService validates trades then calls DAO. PortfolioService computes holdings and total value. RiskService delegates the risk math to a plug in Strategy."
