							"left": 32,
							"top": 8,
							"width": 358.119873046875,
							"height": 91.5,
							"text": "What this shows. A Factory is a one stop place to create the right kind of object. AssetFactory looks at an incoming request and creates a Stock ETF Bond or CryptoAsset. TransactionFactory similarly creates a BuyTransaction or SellTransaction. This avoids spreading long if else chains across the codebase."
