							"height": 96,
							"text": "What this shows. Strategy pattern means swap the algorithm without rewriting the caller. RiskService does not know how risk is calculated it just calls a Strategy. Today we plug in VolatilityRiskStrategy a statistical formula based on past prices. Tomorrow we can plug in a different strategy with no code changes upstream."
