									"text": "What this shows. Step by step how POST /api/v1/transactions/buy works. The service checks the account and asset exist then calls a SQL stored procedure that atomically debits cash inserts the transaction row and writes an audit log. If cash is insufficient the procedure returns an error mapped to HTTP 409."
